WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.522
Now we expose the model components that pipeline hid.

00:00:03.522 --> 00:00:11.447
We still use q w e n three zero point six billion, so the teaching example stays consistent.

00:00:11.447 --> 00:00:15.512
Auto tokenizer loads the matching tokenizer.

00:00:15.512 --> 00:00:20.847
Auto model for causal L M loads the decoder language model.

00:00:20.847 --> 00:00:29.322
The data type is selected automatically, and device map auto lets the loading stack place model weights on available

00:00:29.322 --> 00:00:31.887
hardware. The model is unchanged.

00:00:31.887 --> 00:00:35.118
We simply have more direct access to its pieces.
